{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56296","headline":"边上秋望 · 元昉","name":"边上秋望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草秋宜病马，风疾称饥鹰。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷十四正字王玄《诗中旨格》。\n）（按：《唐文拾遗》卷五十据《安阳金石录》收元昉开元七年作《大唐邺县修定寺传记》。\n传谓其爲「开元中修定寺僧」。\n未详与此诗作者是一人否。\n今不取。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元昉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}